[0.015, "o", "Run, inspect and fix each monolith worktree's services (Dev Control Center).\r\n\r\nUsage: dev-center [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]\r\n\r\nCommands:\r\n  gui        Open the app, or bring it forward on this worktree's Services page\r\n  status     Live state of every service: PID, port, URL, CPU, memory, errors\r\n  context    A Markdown brief of this worktree for an LLM: status, wiring, recent failures and the\r\n             exact commands to fix things. No secrets\r\n  urls       Every service's stable URL in this worktree\r\n  worktrees  The monolith worktrees the app knows, with what each is running\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "  tabs       Active worktree tabs in activation order. Needs the running app\r\n"]
