[0.019, "o", "Create a new monolith worktree with every submodule checked out (like scripts/create_worktree.py,\r\nbut faster and safer). Does not need the app. Try --dry-run first to see the plan\r\n\r\nUsage: dev-center create [OPTIONS]\r\n\r\nOptions:\r\n      --branch <BRANCH>         Monolith branch. With --new-branch: where new work starts (default\r\n                                main). With --attach: the branch to continue. Otherwise: a detached\r\n"]
