[0.021, "o", "dev-center 0.7.0\r\n\r\n# dev-center manual\r\n\r\nThis is the long-form built-in reference for the `dev-center` binary: the\r\nDev Control Center app and its command line, in one executable.\r\n\r\nWhy this exists:\r\n- developers may only have the binary available\r\n- LLMs (Claude, Codex, Pi, ...) need a stable, self-contained teaching surface\r\n- `--help` is good for quick lookup, but not for learning the tool\r\n\r\n"]
