[0.534, "o", "# Dev Control Center context: monolith-demo-new-heatmap-7de1\r\n\r\nYou are helping with one git worktree of the Diversio monolith, run by the Dev Control Center app. Every service runs in a terminal inside that app; drive and inspect it with the `dev-center` CLI below rather than starting processes yourself. Exactly one app runs per developer: never open, quit or relaunch the app itself (starting and restarting services is fine); if `dev-center` says the app is not running, ask the developer. Never print or paste secret values.\r\n\r\n## Worktree\r\n- Path: `~/work/diversio/monolith-demo-new-heatmap`\r\n- Branch: feature/new-heatmap · HEAD ae1826b83f12\r\n- URL label: `monolith-demo-new-heatmap-7de1` (services are at http://<host>.monolith-demo-new-heatmap-7de1.localhost, with the bare label for the one without a host)\r\n- App running: yes\r\n- Manifest: `~/work/diversio/monolith-demo-new-heatmap/dev-services.toml`\r\n- URL router: listening on port 80\r\n- Tools: PostgreSQL /opt/homebrew/opt/postgresql@17"]
[0.0, "o", "/bin · Redis /opt/homebrew/bin/redis-server\r\n- Database: not created yet; the first `backend` start creates it empty\r\n\r\n"]
